        {
          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "lem-rational-isotropic-subspace-saturates-to-integral-metabolizer",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $H$ be a free abelian group of rank $2g$ and let $V:H\\times H\\to\\mathbb Z$ be a bilinear form. Write $H_{\\mathbb Q}=H\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Q$ and extend $V$ $\\mathbb Q$-bilinearly to $H_{\\mathbb Q}$. If $L\\subset H_{\\mathbb Q}$ is a $\\mathbb Q$-subspace of dimension $g$ and $V(x,y)=0$ for all $x,y\\in L$, then $M=H\\cap L$ is a rank-$g$ direct summand of $H$ and $V|_{M\\times M}=0$.",
